---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Rough at Sea, a personal logbook for ideas, deep dives, and useful discoveries."
>
  <article class="about-page">
    <header class="about-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">About this logbook</p>
      <h1>Rough at Sea</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Rough at Sea is my personal commonplace book. More often than not, something will strike
        my fancy and I'll ask a frontier model (usually Gemini or ChatGPT) to investigate it for me
        and then write an article here about the thing that struck my fancy in that moment.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="about-sections">
      <section>
        <h2>What you’ll find here</h2>
        <p>
          The subjects are all over the place. If you find a common thread, let me know. As far
          as I can tell my interests are super random. You'll find articles about artificial
          intelligence, games, books, science, medicine, music, storytelling, and more. From my
          point of view, the common thread is curiosity rather than a single niche.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Why “Rough at Sea”?</h2>
        <p class="placeholder">
          "Rough at Sea" is my favorite flavor of ice cream at a local ice cream shop. But the name
          makes sense on many levels. All of our lives are like sailing a rough sea; no one really knows
          where they are going or what they are doing, but doing it feels like a worthwhile adventure.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>About the author</h2>
        <!-- Replace this paragraph with your preferred public biography. -->
        <p class="placeholder">
          I'm just a guy who has way too many interests. Enjoy the content.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p class="placeholder">
          If you have no life at all and are feeling inconceivably bored, send me an email
          at roughatsea@gmail.com
        </p>
        <p class="placeholder">
          Or don't; that's fine too.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }
  .about-header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }
  .about-header::after {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff1493, #93ff14, #1493ff);
    bottom: -2px;
    content: '';
    height: 3px;
    left: 0;
    position: absolute;
    width: 7rem;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--link-color);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 4.75rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .lede {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .about-sections {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2.25rem;
  }
  section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }
  section p {
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .placeholder {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--border-color);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-style: italic;
    padding-left: 1rem;
  }
</style>
